    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Active price rules sharing SBQQ__EvaluationOrder__c (even on different fields).
Why it matters: Tied orders are predictable when rules target different fields, but the moment two start touching overlapping fields the nondeterminism resurfaces. Early warning for PR-001 collisions.
Suppress a finding: when the ties are by design and field-isolation is enforced.
Disable the detector: leave on as a precautionary signal.</value></values>
